#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0261 expect=skipped domain=ADAE
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when AEDECOD is not present in an ADVERSE EVENT sub-class OCCDS dataset (e.g., ADAE).
# The negative half of CDISC-AD0261-invalid-ADAE-declared-scope.cdt: identical columns, no
# structure= / subclass= declaration. Nothing detects OCCDS or ADVERSE EVENT, so the dataset is out
# of the rule's scope and the rule never runs.
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015
---
